    {
      "date": "2026-07-21",
      "decision": "Started a hashtag A/B test with three rotating sets (A/B/C), recorded per post as hashtag_set.",
      "rationale": "Isolate hashtag impact on reach/engagement. A=#fyp #foryou #quiz #trivia #brainteaser; B=#smartorfart #iqtest #puzzletok #riddles #mindgames; C=#quiztime #braintest #canyoupass #puzzle #trivianight. Rotated ~evenly across the 20-post batch (A=7, B=7, C=6 including controls; 14 scheduled arms = A5/B5/C4).",
      "status": "in-flight (metrics pending)"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-21",
      "decision": "Standardized the caption to 'Are you SMART or FART? Comment your score/answer below and follow for more!!' and set Instagram share-to-Feed ON as the default for future posts.",
      "rationale": "Unify hook + add a follow CTA; 'answer' wording only for the no-answer variant (no reveal/score). share-to-Feed default baked into the poster tooling (networks.instagram.details.feed=true); it is only settable at creation, so the current batch's IG posts need a one-time manual toggle.",
      "status": "applied (tooling default); current IG batch flagged for manual toggle"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-21",
      "decision": "Started a TIME A/B — spread the 7 variants across the posting window (evening 18:30/20:30, late-night 23:00, overnight 01:30, overnight-trough 03:30, early-morning 06:30, morning 08:30) instead of clustering them, each variant's IG+TikTok sharing a time.",
      "rationale": "Find the best publish time with a research-backed spread that also samples low-traffic overnight slots. Re-timing required recreate+delete (Publer PUT cannot change scheduled_at). no-answer left at 18:30 (too close to go-live to churn). Recorded per post as time_bucket.",
